尝试用代码实现SCF-HF以增进对计算的理解，后续考虑尝试DFT和CC


Workflow:

Choose basis set → Compute S, T, V, H_core, ERI tensor
         ↓
Form symmetric orthogonalization matrix X = S^{-1/2}
         ↓
Set initial density matrix D (usually zeros or core Hamiltonian guess)
         ↓
    [SCF loop begins]
         ↓
Construct G matrix: G_{μν} = Σ_{λσ} D_{λσ} [2(μν|λσ) - (μλ|νσ)]
         ↓
Build Fock matrix: F = H_core + G
         ↓
Diagonalize F' = X^T F X  →  ε and C
         ↓
C ← X C
Compute new density matrix D_new = 2 * C_occ C_occ^T
         ↓
Check if Δ_rms(D_new, D_old) converged?
      No → D_old ← D_new, return to SCF loop start
      Yes ↓
Compute electronic energy + nuclear repulsion → Output total energy
